		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Blindfolded, feminine angel wrapped in blood-soaked bandages. Celestial martyr.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 15, <strong>HP</strong> 78, <strong>ATK</strong> 4 dagger (far) +10 (1d4+3 + smite), <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +6, <strong>D</strong> +5, <strong>C</strong> +6, <strong>I</strong> +2, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +3, <strong>AL</strong> L, <strong>LV</strong> 16</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Avatar</strong>. Only damaged by magic sources.</p><p></p><p><strong>Smite</strong>. If chaotic, CON 18+ or reduced to 0 HP with a death timer of 1.</p><p></p><p><strong>Stigmatic Aura</strong>. All chaotic creatures within double near, CON 18+ or begin bleeding, 1d4 damage each round. CON 18+, stabilize check, or healing to staunch.</p><p></p><p><strong>Weapon of Old</strong>. Her black- bladed dagger is a +3 weapon while she wields it. Returns when thrown.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
